WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.393
Morgan opens the Session Option Brief.

00:00:02.654 --> 00:00:04.945
It says the free session is a good idea.

00:00:05.549 --> 00:00:06.635
The wording sounds settled.

00:00:07.232 --> 00:00:09.476
Yet the brief has only prepared a comparison.

00:00:10.032 --> 00:00:12.000
Somebody still has to decide whether the proposal belongs on next month's program agenda.
